            Comprehensive eye care, accurate examinations, and stylish eyewear — all in one
            trusted clinic in Santa Rosa, Nueva Ecija.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book an Eye Exam</a>
            <a href="#services" class="btn btn-secondary">Explore Our Services</a>
          </div>
          <ul class="hero-meta" aria-label="Clinic highlights">
            <li>New optical clinic</li>
            <li>Modern equipment</li>
            <li>Patient-first care</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual reveal" aria-label="Optical care patient experience">
          <div class="visual-card">
            <img
              src="https://scontent.fcrk2-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/542679580_122134947944820523_6495000686571925256_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_tt6&cstp=mx1080x1350&ctp=s1080x1350&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=f727a1&_nc_ohc=0PPXoN9ENAwQ7kNvwHHOigO&_nc_oc=Adok6sJrMstEYB2h6kHRqjj4izmIVr0cIwxsOkrmvhqwIq2s1GZodi52_c2SzngNXX8&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.fcrk2-1.fna&_nc_gid=xOGeyxLw08T8P6eQInEbZw&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_AQKWwct1d7VkRwjoQoWVCaYhpq8pSsU1OnZdxWZk3ss6mw&oe=6A9874DC"
